{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13495","headline":"扈从回銮应制 · 萧华","name":"扈从回銮应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粤在秦京日，议乎封禅难。\n岂知陶唐主，道济苍生安。\n惟彼烈祖事，增修实荣观。\n声名朝万国，玉帛礼三坛。\n纂圣德重光，建元功载刊。\n仍开旧驰道，不记昔回銮。\n羽卫摇晴日，弓戈生早寒。\n犹思检玉处，却望白云端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}